Package: pacfwei
Type: Package
Title: Componentwise Partial Autocorrelations for Vector Time Series
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(person("Simone", "Giannerini", role = "aut",
    email = "simone.giannerini@uniud.it",
    comment = "Original 2007 R and Fortran implementations"),
    person("Local", "Maintainer", role = "cre", email = "simone.giannerini@uniud.it"))
Description: Computes Wei's partial autocorrelations through one function with
    interchangeable C and R recursions, using C by default. Preserves R's
    positive-lag convention and standard acf-class output. Documents the residual
    correlation definition and forward-backward recursion. Includes the annual
    Lydia Pinkham advertising and sales data for illustrating the method.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: stats, graphics
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown
LazyData: true
NeedsCompilation: yes
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
